So much has changed since the day we met 500 years ago.

29
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:34,540
Why, hello there.

30
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:36,580
You must be Sekre, right?

31
00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:37,900
I'm sorry.

32
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:41,600
I would have come to you, but I've been totally buried in my research lately.

33
