110
00:06:52,580 --> 00:06:54,320
He and Licked were best friends,

111
00:06:54,780 --> 00:06:57,860
and soon, they would become family as well.

112
00:06:58,740 --> 00:06:59,700
Is it true?

113
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:00,680
You're with child?

114
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,020
With you for parents,

115
00:07:03,020 --> 00:07:04,460
