116
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:06,080
Hey, congrats, Tetya.

117
00:07:06,340 --> 00:07:07,560
And you too, I guess.

118
00:07:08,180 --> 00:07:10,360
Well, thank you for including me, Raya.

119
00:07:12,060 --> 00:07:13,960
What are you pouting about, Tiny?

120
00:07:14,380 --> 00:07:15,280
It's nothing.

121
00:07:15,740 --> 00:07:16,680
You're still little.

122
00:07:16,820 --> 00:07:18,160
You'll understand one day.

123
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:19,440
Would you shut up?

124
00:07:19,780 --> 00:07:22,260
Stop talking down to me like I'm some stupid baby!

125
00:07:22,540 --> 00:07:24,560
Excuse me then, big man.

126
00:07:25,520 --> 00:07:25,920
Lumiere,

127
