135
00:07:45,900 --> 00:07:48,700
I believe it too.

136
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:52,900
I know that you and I were brought together by destiny.

137
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:57,640
I'm sorry, Tetya,

138
00:07:57,960 --> 00:08:00,780
