142
00:08:09,020 --> 00:08:10,700
but please, don't worry.

143
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:12,800
I'm sure they'll come to understand someday.

144
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:14,980
Yes, and it's all right.

145
00:08:15,100 --> 00:08:16,500
