152
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:31,640
so it must be a coincidence.

153
00:08:32,660 --> 00:08:34,160
I should hurry, or I'll miss it.

154
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:36,240
Oh, my goodness!

155
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:37,840
Good luck!

156
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,260
We wish you the best!

157
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:40,220
Congratulations!

158
00:08:40,220 --> 00:08:42,460
Thank you all very much!

159
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,220
How sweet!

160
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,760
