167
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:03,000
Licht believes it's possible.

168
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:04,960
Maybe they're right.

169
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,920
Elves and human beings,

170
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,560
living side by side.

171
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:11,200
I'm here, Father.

172
00:09:11,380 --> 00:09:12,640
You wanted to speak with me?

173
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,780
Now, bye!

174
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:18,980
What's this?

175
00:09:19,420 --> 00:09:20,140
I'm trapped!

176
00:09:20,700 --> 00:09:21,880
Oh, oh, oh, oh!

177
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,820
Good day, my prince!

178
00:09:24,180 --> 00:09:24,740
Minister?

179
00:09:24,740 --> 00:09:28,960
No, that villainous mana doesn't belong to him.

180
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:30,280
Who are you?

181
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:33,360
Who, me?

182
00:09:34,020 --> 00:09:38,280
Despair, hatred, disloyalty, death, any number of awful things, really.

183
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:40,680
Use whatever name you prefer.

184
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:46,480
I've read about this being a soul from the other world with evil mana.

185
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:47,600
A devil.

186
00:09:48,780 --> 00:09:49,740
Where's my family?

187
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:51,220
Who knows?

188
00:09:51,340 --> 00:09:55,100
Perhaps they've gone to confront that other race that's plotting to use your unwitting princess

189
00:09:55,100 --> 00:09:56,460
to topple this entire kingdom.

190
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:57,840
But that's only a guess.

191
00:09:57,840 --> 00:10:01,200
Imagine how surprised the elves will be

192
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:05,820
when a monster's act of human violence befalls that little wedding ceremony

193
