that only you were supposed to know was happening.

194
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:09,440
No!

195
00:10:09,660 --> 00:10:10,140
Let go!

196
00:10:10,620 --> 00:10:11,140
No!

197
00:10:11,900 --> 00:10:14,320
As soon as I obtain my body in Grimoire,

198
00:10:14,420 --> 00:10:16,940
I promise I'll come back to play with you again.

199
00:10:17,300 --> 00:10:17,820
Wait!

200
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,200
