202
00:10:23,580 --> 00:10:24,120
Please!

203
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:24,600
Prince!

204
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:26,200
Thank goodness!

205
00:10:26,740 --> 00:10:27,280
Oh no!

206
00:10:27,620 --> 00:10:28,280
What's that?

207
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:30,300
I've been trapped by a devil!

208
00:10:30,660 --> 00:10:32,620
I knew you would never do such a thing!

209
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,080
I'm not sure why,

210
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:36,480
