211
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:37,980
Quick!

212
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,620
Use your sealing magic!

213
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:40,500
Of course!

214
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:41,820
Sealing magic!

215
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,200
