218
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:50,080
Tetya!

219
00:10:50,460 --> 00:10:50,700
Licht!

220
00:10:50,700 --> 00:10:51,700
Hold on!

221
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,600
What's going on?

222
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:56,500
It's the humans!

223
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:57,720
They're attacking us!

224
00:10:59,220 --> 00:11:00,760
Everyone this way!

225
00:11:00,900 --> 00:11:01,340
Let's hurry!

226
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:02,560
My spells won't work.

227
00:11:03,340 --> 00:11:04,480
Our magic!

228
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:05,920
It's been sealed away!

229
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:07,460
Let's get down!

230
00:11:11,740 --> 00:11:13,400
This is light magic.

231
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:15,600
Does that mean...

232
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:19,000
This is a mistake!

233
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:21,060
It's not true!

234
00:11:25,820 --> 00:11:26,700
No way!

235
00:11:26,780 --> 00:11:27,220
No way!

236
00:11:27,300 --> 00:11:27,740
No way!

237
00:11:27,820 --> 00:11:28,200
No way!

238
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:28,680
No way!

239
00:11:28,740 --> 00:11:29,960
I won't accept it!

240
00:11:30,740 --> 00:11:31,700
I'll never!

241
00:11:35,700 --> 00:11:37,200
Forget you!

242
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,200
Are...

243
00:11:38,200 --> 00:12:02,360
There's the device we made!

244
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:05,820
His items stored and distributed magic,

245
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:10,100
and their magic stones amplified spells by linking to another world.

246
00:12:10,100 --> 00:12:32,260
That's a five-leaf grimoire!

247
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:34,260
I knew it.

248
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,660
Knew what?

249
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:37,160
Deep inside.

250
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:39,260
I knew you weren't responsible.

251
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:44,120
Please forgive me.

252
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:48,040
I should never have harbored any suspicion of you, not for a second.

253
00:12:49,100 --> 00:12:51,620
You are the future we all believed in.

254
00:12:52,260 --> 00:12:53,640
You represent hope.

255
00:12:55,560 --> 00:12:56,720
What are you?

256
00:12:57,620 --> 00:13:02,380
Right now, my body is filled with an overwhelming amount of negative mana.

257
00:13:02,900 --> 00:13:06,980
I can't control myself, but we mustn't let that devil succeed.

258
00:13:06,980 --> 00:13:07,980
No, Ligt.

259
00:13:07,980 --> 00:13:08,520
No, Ligt.

260
00:13:09,460 --> 00:13:13,660
In order to keep my body and power from falling under the influence of evil,

261
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:16,660
I've absorbed even more negative magic.

262
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:18,420
Stop it!

263
00:13:18,860 --> 00:13:20,080
You can't do this!

264
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:24,300
I'm sorry, but I have one last selfish request.

265
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:26,400
And only you can grant it.

266
00:13:26,940 --> 00:13:27,740
I beg of you.

267
00:13:33,540 --> 00:13:35,820
There has to be another way!

268
00:13:35,820 --> 00:14:01,640
Lumiere, I need you to kill me.

269
00:14:01,640 --> 00:14:23,440
The devil manipulated Prince Lumiere and the elves in order to throw the owner of the four-leaf grimoire into a deep pit of despair.

270
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:29,180
He did so because it's the way a five-leaf grimoire is born,

271
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:33,800
which, in turn, allows the devil to manifest itself in this world,

272
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:36,760
along with his true form and ultimate powers.

273
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:41,780
Where did that creature come from?

274
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:42,760
Run away!

275
00:14:42,760 --> 00:15:00,920
This must be the end of the world.

276
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:15,840
Now, I understand why I was born with such a massive amount of magic power.

277
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:19,600
Don't worry.

278
00:15:20,120 --> 00:15:22,040
I won't let you become a murderer.

279
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:27,780
Who's that?

280
00:15:27,780 --> 00:15:28,500
Look!

281
00:15:29,140 --> 00:15:30,340
It's Prince Lumiere!

282
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:39,560
They stole something I helped create,

283
00:15:39,860 --> 00:15:42,240
and used it to take away the elves' magic.

284
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:47,360
We built that item to make everyone's lives better.

285
00:15:48,380 --> 00:15:49,760
I'm sorry, Prince.

286
00:15:50,020 --> 00:15:50,840
Lady Tetia.

287
00:15:51,340 --> 00:15:53,440
Is there anything left that I can do?

288
00:15:53,440 --> 00:16:09,100
My friends!

289
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,580
This item is our legacy!

290
00:16:13,060 --> 00:16:14,900
We can still make it a good one!

291
00:16:14,900 --> 00:16:22,960
I'll use the item we built

292
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:25,600
to absorb his attack.

293
00:16:34,180 --> 00:16:35,500
I should have known.

294
00:16:35,740 --> 00:16:37,820
It couldn't withstand that much magic.

295
00:16:37,820 --> 00:16:43,180
The beam's stopped!

296
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:45,480
That evil mana's fading!

297
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:47,480
Lumiere...

298
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:51,420
This is your chance.

299
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,140
Do it now.

300
00:16:54,620 --> 00:16:55,480
I can't...

301
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:58,360
You're right.

302
00:16:58,760 --> 00:16:59,760
I have to!

303
00:16:59,760 --> 00:17:11,560
Let's go!

304
00:17:11,660 --> 00:17:12,540
Let's go!

305
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:12,920
Let's go!

306
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:20,400
Let's go!

307
00:17:22,500 --> 00:17:22,980
Let's go!

308
00:17:22,980 --> 00:17:49,160
You may have prevented me from possessing him, but you put on a good show.

309
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:53,880
For the time being, I suppose I'll have to be satisfied with taking his grivoire.

310
00:17:54,040 --> 00:17:58,160
Don't you dare! Stay away! I won't let you have it!

311
00:17:58,720 --> 00:17:59,960
Magic stones!

312
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:04,180
You saw what happened to the elves, didn't you?

313
00:18:04,860 --> 00:18:06,200
You're a mere human!

314
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:11,780
If you used those, you wouldn't be able to keep your form for even a tiny spell! Give up!

315
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:15,820
Never. I'll use these stones to maximize my power.

316
00:18:15,820 --> 00:18:20,080
Sealing magic! Eternal prison!

317
00:18:21,300 --> 00:18:23,100
Wait, I know what you're doing.

318
00:18:25,340 --> 00:18:26,780
Sealing magic, eh?

319
00:18:29,420 --> 00:18:34,900
Her suit presents a bit of a problem, but I can use the magic stones for reincarnation.

320
00:18:35,280 --> 00:18:36,320
Come here.

321
00:18:37,280 --> 00:18:38,260
What's happening?

322
00:18:38,260 --> 00:18:44,660
There's even more despair and pain in store for the soul who possesses the four-leaf.

323
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:47,360
So I'll go ahead and sow the seeds for him.

324
00:18:47,740 --> 00:18:50,180
Forbidden magic, no other pitch!

325
00:18:50,180 --> 00:19:02,240
I'll be sure to work much more slowly and carefully next time, in an era where you two don't exist!

326
00:19:02,700 --> 00:19:04,200
Ha ha ha!

327
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:12,420
Sekurei! Are you hurt?

328
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:14,160
You're alive!

329
00:19:14,900 --> 00:19:17,560
You managed to seal that devil away.

330
00:19:18,560 --> 00:19:23,220
Yes, it should contain him for a little while, but it won't hold out forever, so we...

331
00:19:23,220 --> 00:19:27,060
No! Prince!

332
00:19:28,340 --> 00:19:30,080
This is the way it should be.

333
00:19:30,740 --> 00:19:34,680
I kept my promise to Ligt, so it's...

334
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:35,240
Okay.

335
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:41,200
Don't worry.

336
00:19:41,740 --> 00:19:44,460
I'm going to use the magic stones to seal you.

337
00:19:44,460 --> 00:19:50,080
It probably won't be perfect, but it should at least keep you alive.

338
00:19:50,980 --> 00:19:56,420
If the devil's seal is broken, then the peaceful future we fought so hard for will be taken away.

339
00:19:56,460 --> 00:19:58,100
Think about what you're doing, Sekurei.

340
00:19:58,220 --> 00:20:02,200
If you use any more of that forbidden magic, your humanity's going to be lost forever.

341
00:20:02,560 --> 00:20:04,960
That's better than letting you die here, your highness.

342
00:20:05,900 --> 00:20:07,140
It's just as he said.

343
00:20:07,740 --> 00:20:09,800
You're our hope for a brighter future.

344
00:20:09,800 --> 00:20:22,080
When I finally woke up, several centuries had passed.

345
00:20:25,320 --> 00:20:32,320
So the prince began his long slumber as a statue, and for some reason, I was turned into a bird.

346
00:20:32,320 --> 00:20:40,600
I've been spared, but in the small form, I'll need help from the future mages.

347
00:20:42,980 --> 00:20:46,800
That day, I felt the presence of a powerful hope.

348
00:20:47,520 --> 00:20:50,440
A hope that could stand against that fearsome devil.

349
00:20:58,380 --> 00:21:00,020
Two more for us, huh?

350
00:21:02,320 --> 00:21:09,860
Oh, there's a good boy.

351
00:21:12,980 --> 00:21:13,900
Are you brothers?

352
00:21:14,620 --> 00:21:17,080
Same age, so possibly twins as well.

353
00:21:18,080 --> 00:21:19,200
No, they're neither.

354
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:22,100
This one here is sweet and well-behaved,

355
00:21:22,360 --> 00:21:25,280
and this one, well, he's a bit spirited.

356
00:21:27,060 --> 00:21:30,140
Then there's the fact that they don't look a thing alike.

357
00:21:30,140 --> 00:21:33,360
Hmm, you know.

358
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:38,480
Now, for this spirited little...

359
00:21:38,480 --> 00:21:38,740
Ow!

360
00:21:39,760 --> 00:21:40,320
Ow!

361
00:21:40,960 --> 00:21:41,380
Ow!

362
00:21:41,600 --> 00:21:43,200
A bit too spirited.

363
00:21:49,340 --> 00:21:50,240
Asta, huh?

364
00:21:52,300 --> 00:21:55,600
Well, you've had a tough beginning, but your worries are over.

365
00:21:55,600 --> 00:21:58,680
As of today, boys, this will be your home.

366
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:02,420
Asta, and you know.

367
00:22:02,420 --> 00:22:32,400
Asta, and you know.

368
00:22:32,420 --> 00:23:02,400
We'll be right back.

369
00:23:02,420 --> 00:23:32,400
We'll be right back.

370
00:23:32,420 --> 00:24:02,400
We'll be right back.

